  "title": "Sweet Hot Mustard Chicken Wings",
  "description": "If you are as burned-out on the basic Buffalo-style chicken wing recipe as I am, then this recipe's for you. The hot, sweet, mustardy glaze is a very welcome change of pace from traditional style. Enjoy!",
